{"articleNo":"902","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=902&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"도서관 일반열람실 좌석관리시스템운영예정 알림","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.09.09","hit":"12045","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"292\" bgcolor=\"#008080\" height=\"100\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 72pt; COLOR: #ffff00; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font size=\"7\">알 림</font></span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<font size=\"4\">일반열람실 좌석관리시스템을 다음과 같이 운영할 예정이오니 편리한 이용을 위하여 반드시 </font></span></font><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\">학생증을 발급받으시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: -2pt\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: -2pt\">* 학생증이 없는 경우 ID(학번), 패스워드를 가상키보드에 직접 입력하므로 불편</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\">* 교직원등 기타이용자 및 학생증 바코드가 잘 읽히지 않을 경우 도서관에서 바코드를 발급할 예정</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<font size=\"5\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;◉ 2009.09.30까지&nbsp; 시험운영</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><font size=\"5\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;◉ 2009.10.01 ~&nbsp;&nbsp; 정상운영</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><font size=\"5\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;◉ 자세한 이용방법은 시험운영전 공지예정</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 48pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><font size=\"4\">도서관장</font></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
